WEBVTT

00:29:56.707 --> 00:30:00.764
or just do quiet, concentrated work.

00:30:00.788 --> 00:30:03.443
You definitely cost us
a fortune in extra space --

00:30:03.467 --> 00:30:04.588
(Laughter)

00:30:04.612 --> 00:30:06.926
CA: but I think it's probably
money well-spent.

00:30:06.950 --> 00:30:10.098
SC: Well, thank you for saying
that with a big smile on your face.

00:30:10.122 --> 00:30:11.942
(Laughter)

00:30:11.966 --> 00:30:14.014
CA: What would you say
to someone who said,

00:30:14.038 --> 00:30:19.662
"It's true that some people
hate that sort of open space,

00:30:19.686 --> 00:30:22.509
but people also hate being paid
what they're being paid,"

00:30:22.533 --> 00:30:25.802
like, there's a lot of things
that people would like in their work,

00:30:25.826 --> 00:30:29.249
and that it's actually good for people

00:30:29.273 --> 00:30:32.277
to feel a little bit
of discomfort at work.